WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:06.640
SCP-2305-A: An anomalous document that&nbsp;
manifests methods of neutralizing various&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:13.280
SCPs, all of which are doomed to fail.&nbsp;
So what did it have to say about SCP-682?

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.760
To make a very long and elaborate story short,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.880
through a mix of anomalies&nbsp;
and massive hydrogen bombs,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:25.920
SCP-682 would be transported to the moon and blown&nbsp;
to smithereens in a massive, ridiculous explosion.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.200
Earth is pounded by the resulting&nbsp;
meteors from the explosion.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:34.320
While only a tiny quantity of 682’s blood&nbsp;
survived the bombardment, it managed to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:39.760
regenerate and adapt. It became the size of&nbsp;
Saturn and ended up eating our solar system.

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:43.600
The moral of the story: Don’t&nbsp;
redacted with this gecko.

